{
  "key": 61138,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0575_T24PC0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Have you met the maniac in this city?\r",
        "He’s always bragging about his\n",
        "rare Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0575_T24PC0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "You can’t help showing off the Pokémon\n",
        "you have, don’t you agree?\r",
        "I’d love to show mine to a friend of mine\n",
        "who lives in Violet..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0575_T24PC0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "The Pokémon at this Gym are all rough\n",
        "and tough.\r",
        "They could blow me away in a second.\f",
        "Let me give you a piece of advice.\r",
        "The Gym Leader uses Fighting-type\n",
        "Pokémon.\r",
        "You can try to fool them with\n",
        "Psychic-type Pokémon.\r",
        "Or simply defeat them before they\n",
        "can demonstrate their power.\r",
        "By the way, Chuck, the Gym Leader,\n",
        "is into his waterfall training.\r",
        "He won’t be able to hear you unless\n",
        "you somehow stop the pounding water."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0575_T24PC0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! You won, didn’t you?\n",
        "Your face tells me you did."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0575_T24PC0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh? Do you happen to...\n",
        "have only one Pokémon?\r",
        "That must be hard on you.\n",
        "...\r",
        "That’s right!\n",
        "I’ll give you a TENTACOOL!\r",
        "I just caught a little too many.\n",
        "I was going to release it,\f",
        "so take it. Go ahead!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0575_T24PC0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the TENTACOOL!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0575_T24PC0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Want to give a nickname to\n",
        "the TENTACOOL? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
